# Fixture: map_cheat_set_human_other_nation's output (France 1599, England human; the French Europe state sits on nation[1]).
# Set Human back to French (row 2): England's record is flushed first, France's is rebound, so the French Europe screen (E) shows France's own 429 gold / 26% tax again
# (port_bugs.md #1172). Ends with cheat mode off again (Alt-W).
key w alt
key i alt
key n alt
key F5 shift
key Down
key Return               # French
wait 30
shot
key e                    # French European Status
wait 30
shot
key Escape
wait 30
shot
key w alt
